# ── Dictionary source data ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never commit BKRS: it is large and not ours to redistribute.
# The negations below are load-bearing -- without them a blanket ignore would
# silently exclude the pinned CC-CEDICT snapshot and the test fixtures.
*.dsl
*.dsl.dz
*.u8
*.u8.gz
!Dictionaries/cc-cedict/cedict_ts.u8
!Tests/Fixtures/**/*.dsl
!Tests/Fixtures/**/*.u8
!Tests/Fixtures/**/*.dsl.txt

